			"widgets_values":[
				"subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the navy wide-leg drawstring pants in <Picture 1>, featuring a bright yellow elastic waistband, long yellow drawstrings, a small light-colored logo near the right hip, relaxed straight legs, a roomy side pocket, and a clean loose hem.\n<Subject 2> is the female model in <Picture 1>, shown from mid-torso to feet, wearing a fitted black top, <Subject 1>, and white platform sneakers, with one hand resting in the pant pocket.\n<Subject 3> is the sunlit park path environment in <Picture 1>, with soft-focus green trees, flowering shrubs, warm natural light, dappled shadows on the pavement, and a blurred distant person in the background.\n<Picture 1> is the first frame of [Shot 1], showing <Subject 2> standing on the park path wearing <Subject 1> from a low frontal three-quarter view.\n\nsummary:\n[keyframe completion + reference generation] The target video is a 10-second vertical product showcase for <Subject 1>, beginning from <Picture 1> and using <Subject 2> within <Subject 3> to create a bright, high-energy fashion hook. The sequence moves from a static keyframe into waist detail, relaxed walking motion, and a final hero frame that emphasizes the pants’ color contrast, drape, pocket, drawstring, and silhouette.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the navy color, yellow elastic waistband, yellow drawstrings, small hip logo, wide-leg drape, pocket, and hem shape are retained throughout.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the model’s visible fitted black top, hand-in-pocket pose, lower-body presentation, and white platform sneakers are retained, with only motion added.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the sunlit park path, blurred greenery, flowering shrubs, warm light, and soft background depth are retained.\n<Picture 1> ([Shot 1] first frame): fully_preserved - the opening composition, subject placement, low angle, lighting, and background bokeh match the reference frame.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video is a bright, energetic e-commerce lifestyle video with a crisp mobile-commerce aesthetic, warm natural light, shallow depth of field, and a clean vertical composition.\n[Shot 1] The shot begins from <Picture 1>. A low-angle medium-full shot shows <Subject 2>, the female model seen from mid-torso to feet in <Picture 1>, standing on <Subject 3>, the sunlit park path with soft-focus green trees, flowering shrubs, and dappled ground shadows. She wears a fitted black top and <Subject 1>, the navy wide-leg drawstring pants with a bright yellow elastic waistband, long yellow drawstrings, a small light-colored logo near the right hip, relaxed straight legs, and a roomy side pocket. Her hand rests in the pocket, and white platform sneakers ground the outfit. The camera slowly pushes in toward the waist while the upper frame stays softly blurred, emphasizing the yellow waistband against the deep navy fabric. A short, upbeat pop track begins with a clean snare hit and light synth pulse, layered over quiet outdoor room tone.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, the shot cuts to a close-up tracking view centered on the waist and upper thigh. The camera circles a small arc around <Subject 2>'s side, keeping <Subject 1> in sharp focus while the background melts into green bokeh. The yellow drawstrings sway gently as the model shifts her weight, then her fingers lightly tug the front string, showing the adjustable waist and the soft drape of the fabric. The side seam and pocket opening catch warm sunlight, and the small logo remains legible. A subtle cloth rustle follows the fabric movement under the bright music.\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.000, the shot cuts to a low-angle full-length view of the legs and shoes. <Subject 2> takes two relaxed steps forward along <Subject 3>, the wide navy legs flowing with each stride and the white platform sneakers lifting slightly. The camera tracks backward at ground level, keeping the pant hem, ankle opening, and shoe sole in clear view. Leaves and flowers remain blurred in the background, and the distant figure from <Picture 1> stays soft and unobtrusive. The pop track adds a bass bounce synced to the steps, while light leaf rustle fills the air.\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.500, the shot cuts to a final medium hero frame close to <Picture 1>, slightly wider and brighter. <Subject 2> stops with one hand in the pocket, turns her torso a few degrees toward camera, and lets <Subject 1> settle into its full loose silhouette. The camera slowly pulls back and rises, revealing the yellow waistband, drawstrings, hip logo, wide leg shape, and clean hem line in one balanced composition. The video ends at 00:10.000 on the final product frame, with the music resolving into a bright final chord and a short sparkling pop, leaving only a faint park ambience underneath.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSoft park ambience, faint leaf rustle, and light sneaker footsteps continue under the music throughout the 10-second video.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nAn upbeat 10-second pop track with bright synths, a clean snare, light bass bounce, and a sparkling final chord, used as the audience-only score."
